---
import SectionHeader from './SectionHeader.astro';
import Button from './Button.astro';
---

<section class="py-20 sm:py-28 border-t border-white/[0.08] bg-black relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      
      <div class="lg:col-span-6">
        <SectionHeader
          eyebrow="How I Work"
          title="Software built to be used and inspected"
          subtitle="I build software I want to use every day, and keep working on it until it feels right."
        />

        <div class="space-y-4 text-zinc-400 text-base leading-relaxed mb-8 font-normal">
          <p>
            Most consumer apps ship with analytics SDKs, crash trackers, and sign-in walls before you even get to the main screen. I prefer tools that start fast, keep data on your own disk, and only touch the network when you ask them to.
          </p>
          <p>
            Whether I am working on Levyra's audio pipeline in Kotlin, maintaining my Arch Linux setup in Thalarch Layer, or writing a Python CLI script, the goal stays the same: readable code, low memory overhead, and zero background tracking.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
          <Button href="/about" variant="secondary" size="md">
            <span>More About Me</span>
          </Button>
          <Button href="https://github.com/LUC4N3X" variant="ghost" size="md" external>
            <span>Explore Repositories →</span>
          </Button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-6 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <div class="p-7 rounded-2xl bg-[#0c0c0e] border border-white/[0.08]">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/[0.08] flex items-center justify-center text-[#2997ff] mb-5 font-mono text-sm font-semibold">
            01
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-white font-semibold text-lg mb-2 tracking-tight">Zero Telemetry</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
            No analytics SDKs, no remote crash reporters, and no user profiling. Static APK audits on Apptizo confirm 0 trackers and 0 ad libraries.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-7 rounded-2xl bg-[#0c0c0e] border border-white/[0.08]">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/[0.08] flex items-center justify-center text-[#2997ff] mb-5 font-mono text-sm font-semibold">
            02
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-white font-semibold text-lg mb-2 tracking-tight">Native Runtime</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
            Built with Kotlin, Jetpack Media3 on Android, and native libVLC on Windows instead of heavy Electron or WebView wrappers.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-7 rounded-2xl bg-[#0c0c0e] border border-white/[0.08]">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/[0.08] flex items-center justify-center text-[#2997ff] mb-5 font-mono text-sm font-semibold">
            03
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-white font-semibold text-lg mb-2 tracking-tight">Public Source &amp; CI</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
            Public commit history, automated quality gates, real-device ADB qualification scripts, and reproducible F-Droid builds.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-7 rounded-2xl bg-[#0c0c0e] border border-white/[0.08]">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/[0.08] flex items-center justify-center text-[#2997ff] mb-5 font-mono text-sm font-semibold">
            04
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-white font-semibold text-lg mb-2 tracking-tight">37 Languages</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
            Translated into 37 languages through Hosted Weblate with 100% Android translation coverage and active community releases.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
